  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1901.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1901.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish particulate matter and visible emission standards and operating practices for those incinerators and wood waste burners that are not specifically regulated pursuant to federal incinerator or waste combustor standards or any other chapter, part, or section of this subtitle.\n\nSource. #6483-B, eff 4-1-97 (formerly Env-A 1201); ss by #8294, eff 2-26-05; ss by #10317, eff 4-23-13; ss by #13697, eff 4-23-13; ss by #13697, eff 7-22-23",
